## Why This Is Asked
Moderation on multilingual platforms with code-switching and sarcasm is a real pain point; you need cross-lingual capability, per-language fairness, and privacy.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-lingual transformers
- Code-switching handling
- On-device inference
- Per-language calibration
- Drift detection and rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo for loading model and scoring
async function scoreComment(text, lang) {
  const tokens = tokenize(text)
  const vec = model.encode(tokens, lang)
  const logit = classifier(vec)
  return sigmoid(logit)
}
```

